    "Every finding is compared against this Mac's own recorded history — never against another machine or a fixed idea of \"normal\". Security settings are read with the same commands you could run yourself, without administrator rights; anything that needs privileges Sentry doesn't ask for is reported as unknown rather than guessed, and unknowns never count for or against the score.": {},
