    "Fires when battery health falls by at least this many percentage points below the highest value seen since Sentry last launched. The metric and comparison aren't editable — this rule deliberately ignores health *increases*, which a generic comparison can't express. The baseline resets on relaunch, so this won't catch a drop that happened while Sentry was closed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
